{"id":"n82831-1-9","stage":4,"title":"팔짱 · 抄手","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82831-1-9-1","ko":"날씨가 많이 춥다.","zh":"天气真冷。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"춥다.","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"2","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"大气温度低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e791204fdb48234feaf8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82831-1-9-2","ko":"응. 하도 추워서 팔짱을 끼고 달려왔어.","zh":"嗯，太冷了，我抱着胳膊一路跑来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하도","meaning":"过于，太","explanation":"하도：过于，太","readings":[{"term":"하도","audio":"/audio/a69330a0e09b93c8f165.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84302","senseId":"1","lemma":"하도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"추워서","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"2","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"팔짱을","meaning":"抄手，袖手","explanation":"팔짱：抄手，袖手；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"팔짱","audio":"/audio/1e4491e69de6b391320d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82831","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔짱","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끼고","meaning":"叉，挎，挽","explanation":"끼다：叉，挎，挽；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끼다","audio":"/audio/62c9da6515c8237ff0f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61097","senseId":"3","lemma":"끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달려왔어.","meaning":"跑来，奔来，开来","explanation":"달려오다：跑来，奔来，开来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"달려오다","audio":"/audio/5eb7bd7933c68207325b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64537","senseId":"1","lemma":"달려오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"a69330a0e09b93c8","term":"하도","zh":"过于，太","audio":"/audio/a69330a0e09b93c8f165.mp3","entryId":"84302","definition":"(强调)非常过分或特别大地。","pronunciation":["하도"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"大气温度低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]},{"id":"1e4491e69de6b391","term":"팔짱","zh":"抄手，袖手","audio":"/audio/1e4491e69de6b391320d.mp3","entryId":"82831","definition":"指两臂交叉放在胸前，各放进两侧腋下。","pronunciation":["팔짱"]},{"id":"62c9da6515c8237f","term":"끼다","zh":"叉，挎，挽","audio":"/audio/62c9da6515c8237ff0f1.mp3","entryId":"61097","definition":"互相勾着手指或胳膊。","pronunciation":["끼다"]},{"id":"5eb7bd7933c68207","term":"달려오다","zh":"跑来，奔来，开来","audio":"/audio/5eb7bd7933c68207325b.mp3","entryId":"64537","definitio